ing of Hyrule the last king maybe but  last Queen  hopefully not now it could of course be  that Zelda feels no motivation to  establish a new monarchy but this would  contradict her statement during the true  ending where she says that she wants to  restore the kingdom to its former glory  and perhaps even beyond a kingdom needs  proper leadership and who else then the  last remaining member of the royal  bloodline to fulfill that role and going  back to Zell Inc for a moment perhaps we  will see a link in a position of power  for a change a royal prince rather than  a knight I mean there's obviously  something going on between those two am  i right assuming that both will survive  Ganon's onslaught I couldn't see a more  fitting ending than Ganondorf finally  being defeated once and for all and a  royal wedding at the end between the two  most iconic characters to chime in a new  era in the Zelda franchise thanks a lot  for watching everyone  before I leave it's time to introduce my  latest patreon supporters we have a  whole bunch of new faces so please  welcome Julia Franken Thomas W Drury  Almudena Carrasco Pazzo's I hope I said  that right Lucy Ganon Tristan van  dhansak Jack Thomas Jax powers Twilight  Wolf oh Jessica Chapman Rachel Mills  Milo 90 Dante's Sevilla and dusty day a  big thanks to each and every one of you  for joining this is just awesome see you  all next week and continue to stay safe  this is Don signing off and have a good  one

